        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Jackson\n- Organizations: Phoenix Suns, Kansas Jayhawks, NBA\n- Events: 2017 NBA draft, 2017–18 Phoenix Suns season\n- Topics: Top 5 draft picks\n\nFacts:\n- Josh Jackson played one season of college basketball for the Kansas Jayhawks before declaring for the 2017 NBA draft.\n- In the 2017 NBA draft, the Phoenix Suns selected Josh Jackson with the fourth overall pick.\n- During the 2017–18 Phoenix Suns season, the Phoenix Suns earned a Top 5 draft pick for the third time in five years.\n- The 2017 NBA draft gave the Phoenix Suns the number 4 pick for the second straight year, and that pick was Josh Jackson.",
